        "title": "History of physics",
        "raw_score": 0.9127729118481407,
        "source": "kg"
      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Zīj-i Sultānī (Persian: زیجِ سلطانی‎ ‎ ) is a Zij astronomical table and star catalogue that was published by Ulugh Beg in 1438-1439. It was the joint product of the work of a group of Muslim astronomers working under the patronage of Ulugh Beg at Samarkand's Ulugh Beg Observatory. These astronomers included Jamshīd al-Kāshī and Ali Qushji, among others.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.9934593534235857,
      "temperature": 0.9934593534235857,
